[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3 uid="uid://unitprimitivemeshnormalmap"]

; The one variable: the tangent frame each PrimitiveMesh carries under a normal map. Godot writes
; one constant tangent per face of the PlaneMesh and the BoxMesh, and one round the axis of the
; CylinderMesh and the TorusMesh. A directional, an omni and a spot light each shade the bumps
; through it. The only other normal-mapped PlaneMesh is overexposed, so its bumps barely show, and
; no other scene normal-maps a BoxMesh, a CylinderMesh or a TorusMesh.

